# @tilik/db no longer reads a package-local .env. The single source of truth is the repo-root .env,
# seeded from the authoritative contract at infra/.env.example:
#
#     cp infra/.env.example .env      # from the repo root, then fill in
#
# prisma.config.ts loads that root .env. The two variables this package reads from it:
#   DATABASE_URL             migrate/DDL connection (schema owner)
#   PATIENT_TOKEN_HMAC_KEY   identity tokenization key (used by the API at the trust boundary)
#
# See ../../infra/.env.example for every variable (DB / MinIO / Security / LLM / App) and prod notes.
